  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      85.29,
      570.73,
      539.93,
      581.8
    ],
    "text": "(1) by the repeal of paragraphs (1) and (2) of regulation 4 thereof, and the substitution therefor of the following :-",
    "fonts": [
